<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-AJAX SIGN DANISH MIDFIELDER MICHAEL LAUDRUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AJAX SIGN DANISH MIDFIELDER MICHAEL LAUDRUP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam said on Wednesday they had signed Danish international midfielder Michael Laudrup from Japan's Vissel Kobe on a one-year contract with an option for a second season.</p>
<p>The 33-year-old Dane captains his national side and has previously played for Real Madrid and FC Barcelona.</p>
<p>Laudrup will link up with former Denmark captain Morten Olsen, who will be Ajax team coach next season.</p>
